# P32 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): press the labelled button and the unlabelled toggle, type ab into the placeholder field, press Toggle label and drag the slider well off its default.
# Measured 2026-10-16 from p32-macos-gtk4-final-20261016-015015.png (1520x1176, 2x, halved; origin=frame, 28 pt native title bar). The AppKit file's Labelled button, unlabelled toggle and slider rows landed beside their controls on GTK's taller layout (gtk4-aim-20261016.csv2).
# Labelled button (84,171), unlabelled square (35,217), field (380,263), Toggle label (72,308), slider thumb (148,382). The GTK slider track ends at x 266, so the drag goes to 250, not 300.
# After this file the field must read ab, toggle state ON, and the slider thumb must sit right of its default.
# macOS 上 GtkBackend 的 P32:按鈕、無標籤 toggle 與滑桿重新量測;滑桿拖到 250(GTK 滑軌止於 266)。
